---
import { products } from '../../data/portfolio.js';
---
<section class="slide page portfolio-page" id="portfolio" aria-labelledby="portfolio-title">
  <div class="page-inner portfolio-layout">
    <div class="section-intro"><div><div class="eyebrow"><i></i> SELECTED PRODUCT PORTFOLIO</div><h2 id="portfolio-title">Real products. Real impact. <em>Across domains and platforms.</em></h2><p>Five representative case studies from my product journey. Each project highlights the problem, my ownership, solution, key metrics and the impact created.</p></div><aside class="lens-note"><b>◎</b><span><strong>Portfolio lens</strong><small>Problem → Ownership → Solution → Execution → Outcome. Click to explore detailed case study for each product.</small></span></aside></div>
    <div class="portfolio-cards">
      {products.map((product, i) => <article class:list={['product-card', `product-${product.tint}`]}>
        <div class="product-art"><div class="product-card-meta"><b>{product.number}</b><small>{product.company}</small></div><h3>{product.title}</h3><p>{product.short}</p><div class:list={['product-illustration', `art-${i + 1}`]} aria-hidden="true"><div class="device device-back"></div><div class="device device-front"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><b>{['⬡','⬡','▣','₹','▥'][i]}</b></div></div>
        <div class="product-detail"><div class="product-copy-row"><span class="detail-icon">♙</span><div><b>Problem</b><p>{product.problem}</p></div></div><div class="product-copy-row"><span class="detail-icon">⚙</span><div><b>My Ownership</b><p>{product.ownership}</p></div></div><div class="product-copy-row"><span class="detail-icon">♜</span><div><b>Outcome</b><p>{product.outcome}</p></div></div>
          <div class="product-stats">{product.stats.map(([value, label]) => <span><b>{value}</b><small>{label}</small></span>)}</div><div class="product-tags">{product.tags.map((tag) => <span>{tag}</span>)}</div><a class="case-link" href={product.url}><span>▤</span> View Case Study <b>→</b></a>
        </div>
      </article>)}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
